1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,500
Hey everyone, welcome back to the channel.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:07,000
Today we're looking at why the sky turns orange at sunset.

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,500
When the sun is low, its light travels through more air.

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,000
Blue light gets scattered away, so the reds and oranges reach your eyes.

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,500
That effect is called Rayleigh scattering.

6
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:21,000
Dust and smoke in the air can make the colors even stronger.

7
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:24,500
So the next time you see a red sky, you'll know why.

8
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:28,000
If you enjoyed this video, don't forget to subscribe.
